 while Tadayasu and the others pay a visit to the remodeled Hiyoshi's liquor store and learn about what lies behind the secret door. Oikawa gets depressed about not finding anything important after so much effort to discover about it, and to cheer her up, Tadayasu decides to reveal his secret to her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k7pHTVHdx3Wawu0kuOM6D7aEGFw.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Haruka is worried about her father's demands while Tadayasu and the others pay a visit to the remodeled Hiyoshi's liquor store and learn about what lies behind the secret door. Oikawa gets depressed about not finding anything important after so much effort to discover about it, and to cheer her up, Tadayasu decides to reveal his secret to her.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k7pHTVHdx3Wawu0kuOM6D7aEGFw.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9093","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"13409","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"13409","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"27977","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"80808","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"34263","synopsis":"Tadayasu confesses his secret to Oikawa, but she does not believe him at all. Haruka is picked up by her father who leaves her letter of resignation in Mutō's hands. While Haruka embarks on a trip with her fiancé against her will, the students start to make preparations for the upcoming Harvest Festival. Oikawa and Mutō refrain from telling the boys the truth about Haruka's sudden abscence.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v7TyIOvVI3wvz5FEeDAU2YI7UIL.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Tadayasu confesses his secret to Oikawa, but she does not believ